#: src/window-minimap.c:1086
msgid ""
"This optional plugin reads live player coordinates and ping. It can kick or "
"ban a player only when you confirm an action. It requires access to its own "
"data folder, not networking. After installation, use Allow Data Access here "
"while the server is stopped. Existing signature checks are not disabled. "
"Other Pumpkin builds may require a matching Bridge API version."
msgstr ""
"此可选插件会读取玩家的实时坐标和延迟。只有在您确认操作后，它才会踢出或封禁玩"
"家。它需要访问自身的数据文件夹，不需要网络权限。安装后，请在服务器停止时使用"
"此处的“允许数据访问”。现有签名检查不会被禁用。其他 Pumpkin 构建版本可能需要匹"
"配的 Bridge API 版本。"

#: src/window-minimap.c:1118
