msgstr "已允许 Map Bridge 访问数据。"

#: src/window-minimap.c:1143
msgid "Allow Map Bridge Data Access?"
msgstr "要允许 Map Bridge 访问数据吗？"

#. Translators: Keep the permission identifier fs.write.data unchanged.
#: src/window-minimap.c:1145
msgid ""
"Allow fs.write.data for the exact Map Bridge bundled with Smashed Pumpkin? "
"This lets it exchange live player positions, ping and confirmed moderation "
"actions with this app through its own data folder. No network permission is "
"granted. Only this plugin's saved permission decision is updated; other "
"plugins, blocked permissions and signature checks stay unchanged."
msgstr ""
"要为 Smashed Pumpkin 附带的这一特定 Map Bridge 插件授予 fs.write.data 权限"
"吗？这将允许它通过自身的数据文件夹与此应用交换实时玩家位置、延迟和已确认的玩"
"家管理操作。不会授予网络权限。仅更新此插件已保存的权限设置；其他插件、被阻止"
"的权限和签名检查均保持不变。"

