#: src/window-minimap.c:1297
msgid "Enable the Minimap?"
msgstr "要启用小地图吗？"

#: src/window-minimap.c:1298
msgid ""
"The minimap increases CPU, memory and disk activity. Higher player update "
"rates use more resources. It uses the local Map Bridge plugin to send player "
"names, positions, viewing direction, ping and world information to Smashed "
"Pumpkin through the plugin's own data folder. This data stays on this "
"computer; it is not sent to an external service. The map reads saved terrain "
"without generating or loading server chunks. Bridge installation and data "
"access are confirmed separately while the server is stopped. You can disable "
"the minimap at any time in Settings."
msgstr ""
"小地图会增加 CPU、内存和磁盘的使用量。玩家更新频率越高，消耗的资源越多。它使"
"用本地 Map Bridge 插件，通过插件自身的数据文件夹将玩家名称、位置、视线方向、"
"延迟和世界信息传递给 Smashed Pumpkin。这些数据仅保留在本机，不会发送到外部服"
"务。地图会读取已保存的地形，不会生成或加载服务器区块。桥接插件的安装和数据访"
"问权限需要在服务器停止时分别确认。您可以随时在设置中禁用小地图。"

